<title>USA: Kaman Corp Q4 diluted shr $0.30 vs $0.21.</title>
<headline>Kaman Corp Q4 diluted shr $0.30 vs $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD, Conn. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>KAMAN CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		   Condensed Consolidated Summaries of Earnings</p>
<p>		     (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					  December 31     December 31</p>
<p>				    1996	 1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues		     $239,102 $241,541 $953,654 $899,476</p>
<p> Net earnings		    7,129    4,818   23,577   19,602</p>
<p> EPS (Primary)		     .33	.21     1.06	.86</p>
<p> (Fully diluted)		   .30	.21     1.00	.85</p>
<p>Average common shares</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>  -Primary		     18,884    18,571   18,736   18,512</p>
<p>  -Fully diluted	     24,905    24,543   24,732   24,491</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter and full year 1996 net earnings include a pre-tax gain of approximately $4.0 million, or 12 cents per common share, on the sale of real estate within the Diversified Technologies segment.</p>
<p>1995 results also include a pre-tax gain of approximately $1.8 million, or six cents per common share, on the sale of real estate within the Diversified Technologies segment.</p>
